' ================= RELATIONSHIPS =================

' --- Mentor assignment & scheduling ---
ApplicationDetailController .down.> ApplicationDetailService : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .up.|> ApplicationDetailService : implement
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> ApplicationDetailRepository : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> ApplicationRepository : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> ApplicationService : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> RoundRepository : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> MentorService : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> MentorRepository : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> SessionService : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> JwtUtils : use
ApplicationDetailController .down.> AssignMentorsRequestDto : use
ApplicationDetailController .down.> ScheduleDecisionRequest : use
ApplicationDetailController .down.> CancelScheduleRequest : use
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> MentorPendingScheduleResponse : create
ApplicationDetailServiceImpl .down.> MentorResponse : create

ApplicationDetail "1" *-down- "0..1" RoundSessionInfo : owns
RoundSessionInfo "1" *-down- "0..*" ScheduleHistoryEntry : owns
RoundSessionInfo .right.> MeetingType : use
ScheduleHistoryEntry .right.> ScheduleEventType : use
ApplicationDetail .right.> ApplicationDetailStatus : use
ApplicationDetail "0..1" -right-> "1" MentorReview : references (mentorReview)

' --- Mentor video interview session (Daily.co) ---
SessionController .down.> SessionService : use
SessionServiceImpl .up.|> SessionService : implement
SessionServiceImpl .down.> SessionRepository : use
SessionServiceImpl .down.> ApplicationRepository : use
SessionServiceImpl .down.> ApplicationDetailRepository : use
SessionServiceImpl .down.> MentorReviewRepository : use
SessionServiceImpl .down.> MentorFeedbackRepository : use
SessionServiceImpl .down.> PaymentService : use
SessionRepository -up-|> JpaRepository : extend
Session .right.> SessionStatus : use
SessionController .down.> CreateRoundSessionRequest : use
SessionController .down.> JoinSessionDtoRequest : use
SessionController .down.> SessionDetailResponse : create
SessionDetailResponse .down.> MentorReviewResponse : use
SessionDetailResponse .down.> MentorFeedbackResponse : use

Session "1" *-right- "0..1" MentorReview : owns (shares PK)
Session "1" *-right- "0..1" MentorFeedback : owns (shares PK)

' --- Mentor STAR evaluation & candidate feedback ---
MentorReviewController .down.> MentorReviewService : use
MentorReviewServiceImpl .up.|> MentorReviewService : implement
MentorReviewServiceImpl .down.> MentorReviewRepository : use
