' --- Shared / external ---
Mentor "1" *-down- "0..1" MentorProfile : owns
Mentor .right.> Role : use
MentorRepository -up-|> JpaRepository : extend
MentorReview "0..*" -left-> "1" Mentor : reviewed by
MentorFeedback "0..*" -left-> "1" Mentor : rates
MentorReview "0..*" -left-> "1" User : about (candidate)
MentorFeedback "0..*" -left-> "1" User : given by (candidate)
